  <Name>Double Drive Main Battle Ships Of The Line</Name>
  <Version>3</Version>
  <TotalPoints>3000</TotalPoints>
  <FactionKey>Stock/Protectorate</FactionKey>
  <Description>Difficulty: &lt;color=yellow&gt;MODERATE&lt;/color&gt;

The C30 backpack is used to deny caps, starting with grape and then a salvo of HE. The craft function as a reusable killjoy and to intercept unescorted bombers.
  </Description>
