      <LongDescription>The &lt;noparse&gt;CM-4 HELLJOY&lt;/noparse&gt; is a size 4 direct guidance missile.  It is based on the CM-4 body, which is a heavy anti-ship torpedo.  This missile will deliver a $MISSILEWARHEAD_DETAIL_BLASTFRAG warhead.  It homes in on its target using command guidance from its launching ship.

